<title>AUSTRIA: NORDIC COMBINED-RESULTS OF SAALFELDEN WORLD CUP.</title>
<headline>NORDIC COMBINED-RESULTS OF SAALFELDEN WORLD CUP.</headline>
<dateline>SAALFELDEN, Austria 1997-01-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Leading results of</p>
<p>the ski jumping leg of a nordic combined event on Saturday (15</p>
<p>km cross country leg on Sunday):</p>
<p>1. Mario Stecher (Austria) 245.5 points (first jump 88.5</p>
<p>metres/second jump 87.0 metres)</p>
<p>2. Michael Gruber (Austria) 241.0 (87.0/85.5)</p>
<p>3. Jari Mantila (Finland) 230.0 (83.5/86.0)</p>
<p>4. Valeri Stolyarov (Russia) 229.5 (85.5/82.5)</p>
<p>5. Ludovic Roux (France) 226.0 (85.5/82.0)</p>
<p>6. Hannu Manninen (Finland) 224.5 (83.0/84.0)</p>
<p>7. Knut-Borge Andersen (Norway) 223.5 (85.5/82.0)</p>
<p>8. Kristian Hammer (Norway) 223.0 (83.5/83.0)</p>
<p>9. Samppa Lajunen (Finland) 220.5 (84.0/81.5)</p>
<p>10. Felix Gottwald (Austria) 220.0 (81.0/83.0)</p>
</text>
